  "storyBlocks": [
    {
      "id": "final-scene",
      "type": "scene",
      "title": {
        "zhHans": "Final",
        "en": "Final"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "zhHans": "回到过去，而不是进入新的年份",
        "en": "Return to the past, not a new year"
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "none",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "structural-label",
        "sourceIds": [
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "final-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "完成四个季节后，故事没有进入第五个时间点，而是让玩家带着 1981 年获得的信息重新进入旧的 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "memory"
            },
            "label": "记忆"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "。电话、时钟和房间里的装置开始跨越年份互相回应。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "After the four seasons are complete, the story does not move to a fifth date. Instead, knowledge gained in 1981 is carried back into earlier "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "memory"
            },
            "label": "memories"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", where the telephone, clock, and machinery begin to answer one another across years."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "final-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "玩家对过去做出的改变会累积："
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "harvey"
            },
            "label": "Harvey"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 的处境可以被改变，房间中的物件也能为后来的机器准备条件。Seasons 因而把“解开房间”转化成“重写一段已经发生的记忆”。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Changes made in the past accumulate: "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "harvey"
            },
            "label": "Harvey"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " can be given a different outcome, while objects in the room can be prepared for the later machine. Seasons turns room escape into the rewriting of an already-lived memory."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "final-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "最终路径回到 1964 年春天，并试图改变 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "laura-vanderboom"
            },
            "label": "Laura"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 的命运。这里最重要的不是一套新的谜题，而是前四章终于被证明属于同一条可以被反向影响的因果链。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The final path returns to spring 1964 and attempts to change "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "laura-vanderboom"
            },
            "label": "Laura"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "’s fate. What matters is not a new set of puzzles, but the revelation that the first four chapters belong to one causal chain that can be influenced backward."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "major",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
