    {
      "id": "final-note",
      "type": "note",
      "title": {
        "zhHans": "为什么 Final 没有年份？",
        "en": "Why does Final have no year?"
      },
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Final 是一次跨季节回访，不是新的独立时间点。因此数据模型保留 narrativeOrder=5，但 timeline=null，避免为了排序虚构年份。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Final revisits existing seasons rather than introducing a new independent date. The model keeps narrativeOrder=5 while leaving timeline=null instead of inventing a year for sorting."
          }
        ]
      },
